                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4489b07e-c5da-4894-bb93-7e202e179fb7",
                                "sense_id": "638e776d-fcd4-3745-bbaa-6e48c8375602",
                                "text": "he neuer so cunning and his craftsmaster euery way"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9417102-56bf-4444-8bad-256282acbae9",
                                "sense_id": "638e776d-fcd4-3745-bbaa-6e48c8375602",
                                "text": "Well, the matter seems clear to me,\" said the craftmaster of the weavers and dyers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e521175-57f6-4495-a53a-9addd46a6578",
                                "sense_id": "638e776d-fcd4-3745-bbaa-6e48c8375602",
                                "text": "\"Why is he a craftmaster, Father?\" Marcyl's big black eyes fixed on Caliostrus. \"Because he's one of the best cabinetmakers in all of L'Excelsis. That's why.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd48345e-ab4b-34fa-accd-7471a79b2965",
                        "entry_id": "b4b96624-d916-369a-99bd-867c1174b25c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who is in charge of the operation of a vehicle that has multiple crew members."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5335d73-589d-459d-ba83-1602fd20fcd5",
                                "sense_id": "fd48345e-ab4b-34fa-accd-7471a79b2965",
                                "text": "What can a craftmaster do when an anchor line gets wrapped around both screws of the 65- foot Navy craft he is operating ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f758df6-e626-4189-a89d-46e6eeef1604",
                                "sense_id": "fd48345e-ab4b-34fa-accd-7471a79b2965",
                                "text": "In order to properly manage the collision avoidance event, the craftmaster and navigator will be expected to complete previously defined communication exchanges."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e62d7fbd-41ee-4f17-9d03-79f6168984d4",
                                "sense_id": "fd48345e-ab4b-34fa-accd-7471a79b2965",
                                "text": "It seemed that the YW-123's craftmaster had been to see the CO to ask for help on his craft; he had a chief engineer, a relatively new engineman 1ˢᵗ class who hadn't been aboard for very long, and he was having trouble getting the crew members to do their jobs."
                            }
